{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022a.q26.material.recovered", "text": "张老师在上《在美术世界中遨游》一课时，为了使学生能够全面了解美术的分类，他以教材中的美术作品为例，滔滔不绝地讲述了绘画艺术的分类和特点。最后，他展示汉代雕像《立马》和宋代瓷枕《孩儿枕》的图片，提问学生：“这两件作品属于同一艺术类别吗？”学生无法回答……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8527782cb2207d3ab99ef4b64eaf7125590b22d085eddce0261a112726aa7134", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1927, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2053, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 26, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "8527782cb2207d3ab99ef4b64eaf7125590b22d085eddce0261a112726aa7134"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022a.q26"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s1.k08", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s4.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.314.r004", "ntce.outline.314.r005", "ntce.outline.314.r009", "ntce.outline.314.r020", "ntce.outline.314.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022a.q26"], "word_count": 126, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8527782cb2207d3ab99ef4b64eaf7125590b22d085eddce0261a112726aa7134", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1927, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2053, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "rol