{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022a.q27.material.recovered", "text": "在《剪纸》一课的评价环节，陈老师将全班学生的剪纸作品展示出来，采用网络投票的方式，选出10幅最优秀的作业。有学生反映：“不公平。有人用拉票软件……”可是，陈老师觉得应该鼓励学生，依旧把选出的10幅作业都归为优秀。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8527782cb2207d3ab99ef4b64eaf7125590b22d085eddce0261a112726aa7134", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2091, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2197, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "8527782cb2207d3ab99ef4b64eaf7125590b22d085eddce0261a112726aa7134"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022a.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s2.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.314.r010", "ntce.outline.314.r012", "ntce.outline.314.r013", "ntce.outline.314.r020", "ntce.outline.314.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022a.q27"], "word_count": 106, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "8527782cb2207d3ab99ef4b64eaf7125590b22d085eddce0261a112726aa7134", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2091, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2197, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", 